# This machine has a global git excludesfile with
# **/.claude/settings.local.json (Claude Code's usual "local, not
# version-controlled" convention). We deliberately want this file
# tracked in THIS repo -- it's the reusable, non-path-bound permission
# baseline for the template -- so negate it here to override the
# global rule for this repo specifically.
!.claude/settings.local.json
